      ":question/problem": "$S = 100t + 50$\nThe formula above shows the relationship between the speed $S$, in kilometers per hour, and the throttle level $t$ of an electric scooter. When $t = 0$, the scooter is stationary. When $t = 1$, the scooter is at full throttle. It is recommended that $t$ be between $0.1$ and $0.7$ for safe riding. Which inequality describes the target speed $S$ while riding?"
